OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy initially but with cloud
OL,7,Fbuilding across the region through the
OL,8,Fevening and overnight. Mist and low
OL,9,Fcloud developing in places with the
OL,10,Fodd spot of rain possible. Mild, and
OL,11,Ffeeling muggy across the region.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cloudy start with coastal
OL,14,Fmist and isolated showers. A band of
OL,15,Fpersistent, potentially heavy rain
OL,16,Fmoves northwards during the early
OL,17,Fafternoon, with a risk of thunder and
OL,18,Fhail.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
